# Generated state — the database is the source of truth.
# Rendered markdown, written by docs-api on every deploy:
docs/
# Built site, written by mkdocs build (rsynced atomically):
site/
# Generated nav child-config (INHERIT: mkdocs.yml + nav), rewritten every deploy:
mkdocs.nav.yml
# Search index sidecar written next to the rendered markdown:
.search_index.json
